# A notice raised the way the clip companion raises one appears over the
# launcher without taking it over, leaves on its own, and is kept in the
# Notifications list behind the bell until it is cleared.
wait-for Cobalt
wait-for 1 of
expect-missing 1 new
notice How the river found its way to the sea, and what the town beside it learnt
wait-for Article arrived
expect How the river
shot notice-one
# About four seconds, then gone, and the bell says one is new.
wait 5000
expect-missing Article arrived
expect 1 new
expect App Store
shot notice-gone
# Several at once are one card, which grows rather than queues.
notice A walk in the hills
notice The lighthouse keeper
notice Notes on bread
wait-for 3 articles arrived
expect and 2 more
shot notice-collapsed
# Tapping a card that stands for several opens the list, newest first, by
# day, with what was new still marked for this visit.
tap 3 articles arrived
wait-for Notifications
expect Today
expect Notes on bread
expect New
expect Clear all
shot notifications
# Back on the launcher, opening the list has marked everything read.
tap Back
wait-for Cobalt
expect-missing 4 new
# Clearing asks first, and keeping changes nothing.
tap-id notifications
wait-for Notifications
tap Clear all
wait-for Clear all notifications?
shot notifications-clear
tap Keep
wait-for Notes on bread
tap Clear all
wait-for Clear all notifications?
tap-id clear-notifications-confirmed
wait-for Nothing new
expect Articles you send from your computer show up here.
shot notifications-empty
tap Back
wait-for Cobalt
